{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-24T03:57:59.246Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"8f63521dbf8bd2e96a13dba9","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-24T03:57:59.246Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:59.246Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"The pinned SDK build and both TypeScript checks passed. The unrepaired full suite was 344/391 with 35 failures and 12 cancellations. Failure classes by first top-level name:\n- packed CLI snapshot/drift work without git and leave the SDK tracker unchanged: old harness delivered the typed refusal directly. Native read-output validation, now exercised by the harness, requires moved before rendering. Attach an empty moved collection so invalid_estimate, remedy, and status 2 are delivered. The packed CLI also proves valid empty and nonempty comparisons and durable tracker byte equality. The existing imported issue pm-gantt-chart-github-072477cd0a70-253 tracks the public reproduction.\n- validation receipts are immutable and unforgeable, and missing SDK sources refuse cleanly, and non-git CLI replays complete producer envelopes and applies all shared reader bounds: the old harness forwarded extra options. The host refuses unknown_option before dispatch. Assert this and send declared options for missing-tracker and oversized-file tests.\n- 2000 seeded extreme histories and forecasts produce bounded outputs or read-only refusals: the host now rejects array values for the scalar quantiles flag with extension_flag_value_invalid. Assert the rejection and run forecasts with the native comma-separated value.\n- the Git brand kit is an exact build-time pin and published runtime source imports only baked values: switch the exact build-time test to the published version and registry integrity. Baked values passed the build check.\n- handler harness activates cleanly and setup-dependent cases: the direct baseline inherited global pm 2026.11.22 and its stale-host guard refused writes under the 2026.11.23 pin. The package-local binary passed the retry and all release tests.\n\nRevert proof: removing only moved from the drift refusal failed 1/1 with extension_read_output_invalid. Removing each changelog flag individually failed 4/4 targeted runs. Restored regressions passed 2/2. Initial focused retry passed 7/7. All 15 published dependency bullets remain at their release headings and 49 older entries return.\n\nnpm run release:check at full depth and bun run release:check at quick CI depth each passed 392/392, zero skips/failures/cancellations/todos, 100% lines/branches/functions across 10 required sources, 8/8 workflow checks, zero duplication, production audit, five packed-consumer scenarios, and changelog/date/attestation checks. The linked pm test passed 42/42. Bun lock import passed from the npm lockfile. The SDK testing declaration still describes undeclared keys as passing through, while a declared command such as gantt uncertainty refuses an extra scenarios option. The installed runtime follows the intended native validation."}]}],"before_hash":"7be5eeccd4dbf84b1d099ec5841827b1f3f88c00ca148ab69e23b1f39ec010b9","after_hash":"99ef5440ad5e1e90e4c159071d9dd35e0ecec9b654329c06281d9dd04a2a1523","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"00f4777892656bc8ae1bd6fd3ec908e50210f8a3ea548c59ec247b